# Audio playback

Primary file: `AudioForegroundService.kt` (tags `HiCarAudio` / `HiCarService`).

## Must

- New `MediaPlayer` each play; `prepareAsync`; `setWakeMode`; never reuse after `MEDIA_ERROR_SERVER_DIED`.
- On error: `release` → null → retry with new player (all modes, not only box boot).
- Short greeting: `AUDIOFOCUS_LOSS` must **not** hard-`stopPlayback()` if clip not ~90% done — re-request focus / continue; cap regain attempts.
- `LOSS_TRANSIENT`: pause + resume timeout (~1.5s); if focus never returns, best-effort resume.
- Stall watchdog: if `!isPlaying` mid-clip without focus-wait → retry.
- Log focus / stop / retry via `HiCarDiagnosticLog` with position/duration.

## Don't

- Call `requestAudioFocus` synchronously inside focus callback (post to Handler).
- `release()` MediaPlayer synchronously inside its own error/completion callback (post).
- Leave dead `MediaPlayer` instance for next `reset()`.

## Flutter side

- `playGreetingViaNative` may fall back to bundled asset if active file missing/invalid.
- Default greeting UI only when Demo Beta on; silent fallback still allowed.
